{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41833","headline":"赠重安寂道者 · 李中","name":"赠重安寂道者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒松肌骨鹤心情，混俗陶陶隐姓名。\n白发只闻悲短景，红尘谁解信长生。\n壶中日月存心近，岛外烟霞入梦清。\n每许相亲应计分，琴余常见话蓬瀛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41833.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41833","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}